# local test-VM harness (contains credentials + large binary dumps) — never commit
vm

# Fleet capture evidence: the oracle client's bitstream dumps and the
# transport dumps are hundreds of MB to gigabytes each. They are
# REGENERABLE by re-running the gate, and CLAUDE.md has always said they
# must not be committed -- but nothing enforced it, and 13.6 GB of them
# reached git history anyway (stripped 2026-08-01, see #61h). The README,
# VERDICT.txt, logs and rendered traces beside them ARE the record and
# stay tracked.
PR-demo/mac_bisect_matrix/captures/**/*.bin
PR-demo/mac_bisect_matrix/captures/**/*.dump
PR-demo/mac_bisect_matrix/captures/**/oracle/

# turn pre-flight draft (CLAUDE.md "Turn pre-flight") — scratch, never committed
.turn_draft.md

